  "story": {
    "title": "Weekend....downloading...ugh!",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Mallu has been working all day. She’s a Internet Robot. If you want to be a Internet Robot, and if you think that robots don’t go to school, they do. The World Wide Web is they’re school.",
      "Yay! Today is Saturday! And Mallu has been looking forward to this weekend. But she has a problem.",
      "She has received approximately 100 million emails from children all over the world. She is making notes to calculate the amounts.",
      "But there is another 100 emails. What will Mallu do? She doubles the amount of emails and she finds out that 200 emails have to be sent to the other people. But Mallu is tired.",
      "So her friend, Netty, solves the problem. “Mallu, you get some rest. The Internet also has some time to sleep, not only humans.” Look, traveling is fun too!",
      "So Mallu gets some rest. And in the morning, she finds her work done and her boss says her work is amazing. Now Mallu is a very happy robot. You can see her, smiling back at you while she does her work!"
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Mallu has been working all day.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mallu đã làm việc cả ngày rồi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She’s a Internet Robot.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô ấy là một Robot Internet."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "If you want to be a Internet Robot, and if you think that robots don’t go to school, they do.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nếu con muốn trở thành một Robot Internet, và nếu con nghĩ robot không đi học, thì thật ra chúng có đi đấy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The World Wide Web is they’re school.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mạng lưới Toàn cầu (World Wide Web) chính là trường học của chúng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Yay! Today is Saturday!",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hoan hô! Hôm nay là thứ Bảy!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "And Mallu has been looking forward to this weekend.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Và Mallu đã rất mong chờ cuối tuần này."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But she has a problem.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng cô ấy lại có một vấn đề."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She has received approximately 100 million emails from children all over the world.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô ấy đã nhận được khoảng 100 triệu email từ các bạn nhỏ trên khắp thế giới."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She is making notes to calculate the amounts.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô ấy đang ghi chú để tính toán số lượng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But there is another 100 emails.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng lại có thêm 100 email nữa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "What will Mallu do?",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mallu sẽ làm gì đây?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She doubles the amount of emails and she finds out that 200 emails have to be sent to the other people.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô ấy nhân đôi số email lên và nhận ra rằng có tới 200 email cần được gửi cho những người khác."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But Mallu is tired.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng Mallu thì mệt rồi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "So her friend, Netty, solves the problem.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Thế là bạn của cô ấy, Netty, đã giải quyết vấn đề."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Mallu, you get some rest.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Mallu, cậu nghỉ ngơi một chút đi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The Internet also has some time to sleep, not only humans.” Look, traveling is fun too!",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Internet cũng có lúc cần ngủ chứ, không chỉ riêng con người đâu.” Nhìn kìa, đi du lịch cũng vui nữa!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "So Mallu gets some rest.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Thế là Mallu đi nghỉ ngơi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "And in the morning, she finds her work done and her boss says her work is amazing.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Và sáng hôm sau, cô ấy thấy công việc của mình đã hoàn thành và sếp nói công việc của cô ấy thật tuyệt vời."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Now Mallu is a very happy robot.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bây giờ Mallu là một robot rất vui vẻ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "You can see her, smiling back at you while she does her work!",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_165387/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con có thể thấy cô ấy đang mỉm cười lại với con khi cô ấy làm việc!"
      }
    ]
  },
